 "code_fences": "<div class=\"md\"><p>Here is code:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-rust\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">fn</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span>() {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">v</span>: <span class=\"hljs-type\">Vec</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">u32</span>&gt; = (<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>..<span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">collect</span>();\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">println!</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"{:?}\"</span>, v);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>And unlabeled:</p>\n<pre><code>plain text &lt;b&gt;not html&lt;/b&gt;\nsecond line\n</code></pre>\n<p>And js with a long line:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-js\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> x = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">c</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"string with 'quotes' and \\\"escapes\\\"\"</span> }; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// trailing comment</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'/x'</span>); }\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-python\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> [i * <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">range</span>(x)]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Inline <code>code</code> and <code>double `tick` code</code> too.</p></div>",
 "tables": "<div class=\"md\"><table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align: left;\">Name</th><th style=\"text-align: right;\">Value</th><th style=\"text-align: center;\">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: left;\">alpha</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">first row with <code>inline code</code></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: left;\">beta</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: left;\">gamma</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">a <a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">link</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Second table:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><del>gone</del></td><td>x</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
 "lists": "<div class=\"md\"><ul>\n<li>First point</li>\n<li>Second point with <strong>bold</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Nested one</li>\n<li>Nested two\n<ul>\n<li>Deep</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Third</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Step one</li>\n<li>Step two\n<ol>\n<li>Sub step</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Step three</li>\n</ol>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"> done task</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> open task</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Loose list:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>para one</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>para two</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>starts at three</li>\n<li>four</li>\n</ol></div>",
 "links": "<div class=\"md\"><p>Plain <a href=\"https://example.com/auto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://example.com/auto</a> autolink, a <a href=\"https://example.org/a?b=1&amp;c=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">named link</a>, a <a href=\"https://example.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://example.net</a> angle link, a <a href=\"https://example.com/ref\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ref link</a> and mailto:<a href=\"mailto:foo@example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">foo@example.com</a>.</p>\n<p>Raw html is escaped: &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; and &lt;b&gt;bold?&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;a href=\"javascript:alert(1)\"&gt;js&lt;/a&gt;.</p>\n<p><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">bad</a></p></div>",
 "footnotes": "<div class=\"md\"><p>A claim with a footnote<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">1</a></sup> and another<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-note\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2</a></sup> and a repeat<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">1</a></sup>.</p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"true\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"footnote-label\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-1\">\n<p>First footnote text with <code>code</code>. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">↩</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">↩<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-note\">\n<p>Second footnote\nwith a continuation line. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-note\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section></div>",
 "mixed": "<div class=\"md\"><h1>Heading 1</h1>\n<h2>Heading 2</h2>\n<h3>Heading 3</h3>\n<p>Paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <em><strong>both</strong></em>, <del>strike</del>, <code>code</code>, and a hard<br>\nbreak. Escapes: * _ 1 &lt; 2 &amp; 3 &gt; 2 &amp; &lt;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Quote line one</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>nested quote</p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>Term with emoji ✓ é 中文 and a very long unbroken token aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.</p>\n<pre><code>unterminated fence at the end\n</code></pre></div>",
